# The generated search index is a binary artifact — never apply EOL conversion
# to it (a stray CRLF would corrupt the gob byte stream).
/generated/data.gob binary

# Note: source docs do not need `eol=lf` pinning for index correctness — the
# chunker (internal/chunk ParseDoc) normalizes CRLF before parsing, so
# `go generate` produces a correct, line-ending-independent index on any
# checkout (including Windows autocrlf working copies).
